    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The supermarket is closing, and staff are ready to go home\u2014but you have to do your shopping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with a shopping list and zero shame, you\u2019ll slip through shadowy aisles to avoid detection and grab your groceries without causing too much commotion\u2014or lean into the chaos and create distractions to outwit staff. Every step is a delicate dance between stealth and mayhem as you turn a quiet supermarket into your personal playground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Minute To Close is a stealth sandbox game about the chaos of last-minute shopping.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Featuring:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A notorious last-minute shopper (that\u2019s you)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A supermarket full of shop assistants trying to close up shop and go home (you won\u2019t let them)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An interactive supermarket packed with opportunities for sneaky antics and hilarious chaos</p></li></ul>",
